  "servings": 4,
  "summary": "Satisfy your cravings with this bubbly <b>Korean seafood bake</b>, layering tender squid, sweet shrimp, and chewy cylinder rice cakes under a melted cheese crust. A savory gochujang and garlic sauce ties the layers together, providing a fiery yet balanced kick sweetened with a touch of rice syrup. Sliced cabbage, green onions, and sweet onion form a juicy vegetable base that caramelizes as the dish bakes in the oven. Mozzarella cheese melted across the top creates an appetizing golden blanket that tempers the spicy chili sauce underneath. Seafood lovers will appreciate how the tender squid rings and juicy shrimp retain their delicate texture inside the savory casserole. This modern twist on classic street food favorites brings comforting heat and irresistible cheese pulls to your dining table. Serve hot straight from the baking dish alongside crisp pickled radishes for a fun family supper. Experience the vibrant harmony of Korean chili flavors combined with rich baked seafood.",
